OL,3,GNEWSALondoners report 130 hours of
OL,4,Adelays on Tube line
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters on London's District line
OL,7,Fhave reported losing more than 130
OL,8,Fhours to delays and poor service,
OL,9,Faccording to campaigners.
OL,11,FSince the Fix the District campaign's
OL,12,Fwebsite launched in February, commuters
OL,13,Fhave been logging their negative
OL,14,Fexperiences on the Tube line.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
