OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondoners report 130 hours of
OL,4,Adelays on Tube line
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers on the Wimbledon to East
OL,7,FPutney stretch have said the issues on
OL,8,Fthe line were causing people to change
OL,9,Fjobs to avoid having to use it, and
OL,10,Fthat infrequent services and regular
OL,11,Fsignalling problems at stations had
OL,12,Fbecome an everyday frustration,
OL,13,Fcampaigners told the Local Democracy
OL,14,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,16,FTransport for London (TfL) said it had
OL,17,Finvested about #500,000 to improve the
OL,18,Fsignalling infrastructure.
